  "notes": [
    "**Hacer** is irregular in multiple tenses",
    "Present: irregular \"yo\" form (hago), otherwise regular -ER endings",
    "Preterite: irregular stem \"hic-/hiz-\" (spelling change c→z in él/ella form: hizo)",
    "Imperfect: regular -ER pattern based on infinitive stem \"hac-\"",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: irregular past participle **hecho**",
    "Future: irregular stem \"har-\" (not \"hacer-\")",
    "Condicional: irregular stem \"har-\" + conditional endings",
    "Used in many expressions: *hace frío* (it's cold), *hacer ejercicio* (to exercise), *hacer cola* (to wait in line)",
    "Weather expressions: *Hace calor* (It's hot), *Hace sol* (It's sunny)",
    "Time expressions: *Hace dos años* (Two years ago)"
  ],
